  "bodyText": "Insacret\nEnglish\nInstagram Story Viewer\nInstagram Downloader\nFrequently Asked Questions\nWill the person know if I’ve taken a screenshot while viewing their story anonymously?\nNo, Insacret does not notify users when someone takes a screenshot of their story.\nHow can I view highlights?\nTap the highlight you want to view from the highlights list at the bottom of the user profile.\nCan I see who is tagged in a story?\nYes, you can check the people mentioned by clicking the ⓘ button in the top right corner of the story.\nIs Insacret safe to use?\nYes. We always care about user's privacy. Your activity is being kept hidden. Stay anonymous, Feel Safe.\nIs viewing Instagram stories free?\nSure. Our tool is completely free. Paste and look up any Instagram profile.Social media management\nHow can I use anonymous story viewer?\nEnter the username of the public Instagram account whose stories you want to view, and select the story. The account owner won’t be notified of your viewing.\nInsacret\n\nAnonymous Instagram Story Viewer — view stories safely and privately.\n\nHelgonabacken 12\n\n222 22 Lund, Skåne, Sweden\n\nOur servers are securely hosted in Sweden 🇸🇪\n\nAbout Us\nContact",
